{"ts":"2026-07-04T07:10:33.290Z","author":"maintainer-agent","op":"note_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-07-04T07:10:33.290Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/notes","value":[{"created_at":"2026-07-04T07:10:33.290Z","author":"maintainer-agent","text":"2026-07-04 sandbox repro: pm extension scaffold <name> --capability commands --directory <path> fails with unknown_option and next_steps offer NO nearest-flag suggestion (scaffold has no --directory; scaffolds into <cwd>/<name>). Guidance should either suggest closest supported flags for the subcommand or state the target-directory behavior."}]}],"before_hash":"eabd4651151327dcbd4f02112efb885940af88a556b0ea08dced3ec899b30532","after_hash":"a9d2fc401ee636fbaba1a0b4f78ad3776b6fd442a1bf725191505f1489a9fecf"}
{"ts":"2026-07-04T08:51:43.526Z","author":"maintainer-agent","op":"note_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/notes/1","value":{"created_at":"2026-07-04T08:51:43.525Z","author":"maintainer-agent","text":"2026-07-04 sandbox audit adds two output-verbosity nits to this polish bundle: pm init prints all 21 created dirs as full absolute paths (relative paths + count would do); pm extension --list/--doctor repeat long absolute roots and managed-source blocks per extension. Core toon outputs (list/get/context) measured compact (~89 chars/item)."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-07-04T08:51:43.526Z"}],"before_hash":"a9d2fc401ee636fbaba1a0b4f78ad3776b6fd442a1bf725191505f1489a9fecf","after_hash":"f457a7f1f82a4b05f07cef954fcabe233e9ad3c6f547d7affa475d7918c282d8"}
{"ts":"2026-07-04T10:38:35.256Z","author":"maintainer-agent","op":"note_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/notes/2","value":{"created_at":"2026-07-04T10:38:35.252Z","author":"maintainer-agent","text":"2026-07-04 partial progress landed in working tree and verified from fresh tarball pack: (1) pm context <id> now returns dedicated guidance (context_takes_no_item_argument) pointing to pm get <id> / pm context --parent <id>; (2) known-package command hints expanded 4→16 aliases (shell/completion*, comments-audit, dedupe-audit/merge, normalize, reindex, search-advanced, test-runs) with duplicate next-step dedup; (3) extension describe not-found error now lists loaded extension names. STILL OPEN from this bundle: nearest-flag suggestion for unknown_option (scaffold --directory repro still generic), pm init 21-absolute-path verbosity, extension --list/--doctor root repetition."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-07-04T10:38:35.256Z"}],"before_hash":"f457a7f1f82a4b05f07cef954fcabe233e9ad3c6f547d7affa475d7918c282d8","after_hash":"dfef70aeba4e8e5a8265c69917a61a8267742d83a20af1cfe53b2d9b95637fd1"}
